<div n="3"><head>H. <hi rendition="#g">Braun&#x017F;chweig.</hi></head><lb/>
<div n="4" type="jArticle"><dateline>&#x0B83; <hi rendition="#b">Braun&#x017F;chweig,</hi> 17 März.</dateline><p>Wir ha-<lb/>
